    ./bench github-data [state [SPACE]|read ID|private URL|connect|refresh URL|shares|disconnect|leave]
                                       test world: a Space's GitHub cache and owners; read takes
                                       the state a GitHub tab already shows; connect starts the device
                                       flow (code only); refresh reads one row through the API; leave closes the surface
    ./bench site-storage ID [JSON]     test world: state or action open/close/refresh/save/delete
    ./bench site-data ID [clear|closed]  inspect the WebKit records of this site's domain;
                                       clear and reload only in a test world; closed
