    ./bench key ID TEXT                press keys on a tab as real key events — --test runs only
    ./bench press CODE CHARS [MODS…]   press a key on the whole app (cmd shift ctrl opt, let go after it; repeat;
                                       outside: as the physical keyboard, which a bench world ignores) — --test runs only
    ./bench tap ID SELECTOR [cmd|shift|middle|double]  a real mouse click on an element (or text=Words) — --test runs only
    ./bench text ID                    the page's text
    ./bench eval ID JS                 run JavaScript, print what it returns
    ./bench click ID SELECTOR
    ./bench type ID SELECTOR TEXT
