    ./bench space [new NAME|duplicate NAME|credentials [USER]|capture HOST TYPE [allow|deny|clear]|oauth URL|go N|delete|swipe DX|hold DX|release|glide DX [STEPS]|move N|transfer ID N]
                                       test run: independent spaces; duplicate copies organisation only,
                                       switch to the Nth, delete this one,
                                       two fingers DX points sideways over the column (hold: not let go yet;
                                       glide: in STEPS moves, each timed until the window rests, then let go),
                                       move this one to Nth; transfer ID N moves a tab to that space
    ./bench hit X Y [double|middle|click|command] [live]  what a press at X Y (points from the window's top left) lands on,
