                                       seed: test run, a few sites and a folder; many N: test run, N sites siteK.localhost;
                                       rest: answer once the window has rested, with the milliseconds that took;
                                       keep: test run, put the active tab on the shelf;
                                       clear: test run, what the Tabs heading's Clear does (clearable counts what it would close);
